<title>USA: Concorde Gaming has $8.7 mln settlement.</title>
<headline>Concorde Gaming has $8.7 mln settlement.</headline>
<dateline>RAPID CITY, S.D. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concorde Gaming Corp said Friday its Bruce H. Lien Co unit will receive $8.7 million from the Affiliated Tribes in a settlement for ending the company's management agreement of the 4 Bears Casino &amp; Lodge.</p>
</text>
